{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "28日の12時、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41st SGアンダー楽曲\n「愛って羨ましい」のMVが公開されました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の人に届きますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オフショットです📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobG57cCp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます(˶'ᵕ'˶ )‪︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の鈴木佑捺（すずきゆうな）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛って羨ましい 見ていただけましたか？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海の近くでの撮影ですっごく気持ちよかったです🪼\nお天気も撮影日和ぽかぽかでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夜ご飯は6期生で集まって食べたりもしました〜\n夕焼けが綺麗だったな🌛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV撮影ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobEAFqjS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなののブログを読んだら同じような景色を撮ってました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海！！\n海無し県出身というのもあり、\n海を見るとやっぱりワクワクします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今回ポジションがお隣のふたりと！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobF94hcS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなとはいつも乃木坂の話をします(˶'ᵕ'˶ )‪︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobQ33G6a.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お魚デートしました🐟🐟🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢お知らせ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木フラpresents 佑捺の部屋 第3回 の放送が明日31日に決定しました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20:30〜放送です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゲストは、だいすきで尊敬している梅澤美波さんです👑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ緊張でいっぱいな佑捺の部屋ですが、明日も特別な時間をみなさんと作りたいです\n見に来ていただけたら嬉しいです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは\n明日で3月も終わってしまいますねﾊﾔｲ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京は桜も満開なので\n私は同期をお花見デートに誘いたいと思います🌸\n無事誘うことができたら報告します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もみんなが安心して眠れますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}